// GET /api/mes/solder-paste/lots — MES 查询可领用锡膏批次（frozen 状态）
app.get("/api/mes/solder-paste/lots", requirePermission("mes.read"), async (req, res) => {
  try {
    const { q, limit = 50, offset = 0 } = req.query;
    const cond = [`spl.status = 'frozen'`];
    const p = [];
    let i = 1;
    if (q) { p.push(`%${q}%`); cond.push(`(spl.lot_no ILIKE $${i++} OR spl.material_code ILIKE $${i++} OR spl.material_name_zh ILIKE $${i++})`); }
    const where = "WHERE " + cond.join(" AND ");
    p.push(Number(limit), Number(offset));
    const r = await query(`
      SELECT spl.id, spl.lot_no, spl.material_code, spl.material_name_zh,
             spl.supplier_name, spl.qty_kg, spl.qty_remaining_kg,
             spl.shelf_life_days, spl.msd_level, spl.received_at,
             FLOOR(EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM (spl.received_at + (spl.shelf_life_days||' days')::interval - NOW()))/86400::int AS remaining_days
      FROM solder_paste_lots spl
      ${where}
      ORDER BY spl.received_at ASC
      LIMIT $${p.length-1} OFFSET $${p.length}
    `, p);
    const cnt = await query(`SELECT count(*)::int AS total FROM solder_paste_lots spl ${where}`, p.slice(0,-2));
    res.json({ items: r.rows, total: Number(cnt.rows[0]?.total ?? 0) });
  } catch (err) {
    console.error("GET /api/mes/solder-paste/lots:", err.message);
    res.status(500).json(errorEnvelope("SERVER_ERROR", err.message));
  }
});

